Name: damnbot
Version: @RPMVERSION@
Release: 1%{?dist}
Summary: Single-binary AI assistant with tools, gateway, and TUI
License: MIT
URL: https://github.com/damnbot/damnbot
Source0: damnbot_@VERSION@_linux_@RPMARCH@.tar.gz
BuildArch: @RPMARCH@

%description
Damn-Bot ships one binary, local storage, and signed releases. This package
installs the official release binary; install.sh verifies checksums and the
ed25519 signature before installation.

%prep
%setup -q -c

%build

%install
install -Dm0755 damnbot %{buildroot}%{_bindir}/damnbot

%files
%{_bindir}/damnbot

%changelog
* Mon Jan 01 2026 Damn-Bot contributors <maintainers@damnbot.dev> - @RPMVERSION@-1
- Release @VERSION@
